repository-code: https://github.com/takolin-666/genitem
abstract: >-
  Free, browser-based tools to build, adapt and check questionnaires, surveys
  and measurement scales with generative AI, while keeping human expertise in
  charge. AI agents organised in a hierarchy draft and review a pool of items,
  then the AI-GENIE R package retains the most stable items. Other tools cover
  new items, questionnaire review, back-translation, psychometric quality, item
  sorting, condition variation, model testing, open-ended response coding,
  textometrics and verbatim analysis. All language models run locally through
  Ollama: no data is sent to any external service.
keywords:
  - psychometrics
  - item generation
  - large language models
  - scale development
  - local inference
  - Ollama
  - AI agents
  - AI-GENIE
  - network psychometrics
